1e4dad5d-fdeb-4292-a6ec-6d943d65df90	025cfc18-8357-49d6-994e-e0abf0a16f6d	533a228f-b1cc-4212-b814-ace83dae75b7	5	5	4	3	4	Huntington Beach Pier Southside local perspective	Another solid session at Huntington Beach Pier Southside. Conditions were social scene as expected this time of year. Pro tip: best waves are usually early morning before the wind picks up. This place never disappoints if you know what to expect.	2025-08-27	0	2025-08-26 22:41:02.084+00	2025-08-27 16:46:30.596589+00
