121e45e7-e457-418e-b2fb-39dc5eb7bdf8	c2c7cc01-4920-4fd9-941c-68df6b46ced0	bbce7f0b-58f3-4814-a529-b28abce24d4a	5	3	4	5	5	Perfect light at The Wedge	The Wedge never fails to deliver visually! Today's session was skill development and I managed to capture some really dynamic shots. The natural lighting here is incredible and every angle offers something different. Perfect spot for both surfing and photography.	2025-08-24	0	2025-08-18 19:13:03.959+00	2025-08-27 16:46:30.925672+00
